| [[Merry Brandybuck|Merry]] || Colloquial, familiar || Direct statements || Down to earth, commonsensical
|-
| [[Pippin Took|Pippin]] || Colloquial, familiar || Questions, exclamations || Enthusiastic, concerned with food and comfort 
|-
| [[Sam Gamgee|Sam]] || Colloquial, rustic, working class || Inventive, metaphorical || Often politely hedged ("if you take my meaning") 
